      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9915a100000000000d8017",
      "text": "[シャニマス7thライブツアー]で各ユニットが披露",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417441,
      "updated": 1788417463
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9915a100000000000d8018",
      "text": "\t各ユニットが公演で一緒になっているユニットの楽曲と一つ前の公演のユニットの楽曲をカバー",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417441,
      "updated": 1788417540
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99187700000000000d8022",
      "text": "演出で別公演の[カバー曲]について、MCや公式番組で一切言及なかった",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788418168,
      "updated": 1788418168
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99187400000000000d8020",
      "text": "[シャニマス7thライブツアー]の千秋楽が[シャニマス7thTOUR螺旋]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788418164,
      "updated": 1788418164
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9917b300000000000d801e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417971,
      "updated": 1788417971
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ff5",
      "text": "1st（[福岡県]）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ff6",
      "text": " [アンティーカ]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ff7",
      "text": "  [アスファルトを鳴らして]（ノクチル）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ff8",
      "text": "  [Fashionable]（シーズ）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ff9",
      "text": "　[SHHis]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ffa",
      "text": "　\t[FELICE]（イルミネ）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ffb",
      "text": "　\t[純白トロイメライ]（アンティーカ）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ffc",
      "text": "2nd（[神奈川県]）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ffd",
      "text": "　[放課後クライマックスガールズ]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7ffe",
      "text": "\t　[愚者の独白]（アンティーカ）",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1788417407,
      "updated": 1788417407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a99157e00000000000d7fff",
      "text": "\t　[Another Rampage]（ストレイライト）",
